    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ARTEMIS: A meteor?! Seriously?\nAECH: You almost made the park, you realize how huge that is?\nARTEMIS: Do I have the key? No. Not huge.",
      "ARTEMIS: Is that...\nAECH: The Iron Giant? Yeah, just got the commission for it. No big deal.",
      "AECH: It’s mostly about getting the right skins, what you can license, you know? Like Matrix, Matrix kids, forget it, but Star Wars, Marvel, Dark …\nARTEMIS: Golden Age Spielberg?\nAECH: Pre-Jurassic is a bitch.\nARTEMIS: Always wanted the Mothership from Close Encounters.",
      "ARTEMIS: Never thought of that.\nAECH: Oh, yeah, handling is an issue. I mean you can’t build a Giant Robot and have it ride like a Buick Regal.\nARTEMIS: Buick... ?",
      "ARTEMIS: “Theory”?\nAECH: The challenge is unwinnable. It’s designed to drive us nuts."
    ]
  },
